      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 11 months ago",
      "body": "To Lapland 😉\nI want to meet Santa Claus.\nThey have 1 Saturday date left this year flying from Glasgow (400miles away from me!!!)\nIt would cost me £590 for the day trip but that would include EVERYTHING.  Thermal gear, meals, excursions (husky sledge ride, snow mobiles)\nCome and spend the day in Santa's secret underground grotto and graduate as one of his elves. Meet Old Man Reindeer and listen to stories as you learn about the Arctic Circle crossing ceremony.\nSanta's a busy man, but he's made time to meet you and your new friends on your special day. Ask the Elves how to greet him in Finnish and receive a super present.\nWith the opportunity to help the elves decorate their favourite gingerbread cookies, before joining them in their busy workshop to make festive party decorations, your children or grandchildren will have an unforgettable festive adventure\nTaken from first choice\nbrochure\nI want to go",
